text = "Tuesday. Lost my glasses. Looked everywhere I could see, which wasn't far.\n\nWednesday. Buttered something at breakfast. It may have been the cat.\n\nThursday. I'm sure I had them on in the KITCHEN. Or the kitchen had them on. Someone should go and look."
